# DATA PROTECTION

Treat student, guardian, teacher/employee, academic and financial information as sensitive.

Rules:
- collect only approved fields;
- restrict by authorization scope;
- protect exports;
- minimize logs;
- never log secrets;
- protect lower environments from production PII;
- preserve required history.

Guardian records can serve multiple students.

Never delete guardian history merely because a student leaves.
